post and see how often real bookings at that price ended in a published post, how often creators simply never answered, and what brands actually paid at that audience size. Built on 239 real sponsored-post bookings from the Naano marketplace, not rules of thumb. Free, no account required.\n\nBuilt on 239 real bookings\nFree · Built on 239 real bookings · No account needed\nOpen the tool\nFREE\nCreator Campaign Budget Planner\n\nTurn a budget into published posts, not just booked ones\n\nEnter your campaign budget and see how many sponsored LinkedIn posts it books at real "
